  <data name="AssignmentHelpText.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Based on the report date and other filters selected, the Assignment Summary grid reports various merchant counts, amounts, and other metrics at the individual assignment level. If a merchant alerts in multiple assignments, it will be counted in more than one assignment row. Therefore, it is not possible to reconcile between the counts and amounts in the Distinct Merchant Summary and the Assignment Summary grids.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AlertedResource1ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;strong class='color-title' style='display: inline-table;margin-bottom: 5px;'&gt;Distinct Merchant Count - Alerted&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Number of distinct merchants alerted among active Detection Queue Assignments. A merchant can alert in multiple Detection Queue Assignments, or in the same assignment multiple times per day, but is counted once.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong class='color-title' style='display: inline-table;margin-bottom: 5px;'&gt;Distinct Merchant Net Amount- Alerted&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Amount associated with the Distinct Merchant Count Alerted.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="EligibleResource1Tooltip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;strong class='color-title' style='display: inline-table;margin-bottom: 5px;'&gt;Distinct Merchant Count - Eligible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;

Number of distinct merchants that qualify for a Detection Queue Assignment. A merchant can be eligible for multiple Detection Queue Assignments, but is counted once.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong class='color-title' style='display: inline-table;margin-bottom: 5px;'&gt;Distinct Merchant Net Amount - Eligible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Amount associated with the Distinct Merchant Count Eligible.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="RemainingResource1ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;strong class='color-title' style='display: inline-table;margin-bottom: 5px;'&gt;Distinct Merchant Count - Remaining&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Difference between the Distinct Merchant Count Alerted and the Distinct Merchant Count Worked.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong class='color-title' style='display: inline-table;margin-bottom: 5px;'&gt;Distinct Merchant Net Amount - Remaining&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Amount associated with the Distinct Merchant Count Remaining.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="WorkedResource1ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;strong class='color-title' style='display: inline-table;margin-bottom: 5px;'&gt;Distinct Merchant Count - Worked&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Number of distinct merchants that alerted among Detection Queue Assignments and are in a state of Worked. An alerted merchant can be in a state of Worked in multiple Detection Queue Assignments, or in the same assignment multiple times per day, but is counted once.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong class='color-title' style='display: inline-table;margin-bottom: 5px;'&gt;Distinct Merchant Net Amount - Worked&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Amount associated with the Distinct Merchant Count Worked.</value>
  </data>
